# What the chef says over the counter
wg-crew-chef-served = Order up: {$dish}!
wg-crew-chef-greet-1 = Hungry? There's {$dish} on the counter.
wg-crew-chef-greet-2 = Help yourself, the {$dish} is fresh.
wg-crew-chef-greet-3 = Grab a plate. {$dish}, still warm.
wg-crew-chef-greet-cooking = Kitchen's open. Give me a minute and there'll be something on.
wg-crew-chef-ruined = That one's no good. Starting again.
